@mlm_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### Register a user (root member — no sponsor)
POST {{mlm_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Dela Cruz",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "username": "juandc",
  "password": "secret123",
  "sponsorId": null
}

### Log in (returns { token, expiresAt, user })
POST {{mlm_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "juandc",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Current user (requires bearer token from /login)
GET {{mlm_HostAddress}}/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

###
